        <item>
            <title>CopyShot 2.0</title>
            <link>https://github.com/Sayitobar/CopyShot/releases/tag/v2.0</link>
            <pubDate>Sat, 17 Oct 2026 21:36:22 GMT</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>2</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <p>CopyShot 1.1 was a polished proof of concept.
                Version 2.0 is CopyShot’s first major expansion and
                the first big step toward a capable capture-to-action tool.</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>New QR/barcode, LaTeX formula, and table capture modes.</li>
                    <li>Quick Actions, on-device translation, custom URL actions,
                        and shell-script workflows.</li>
                    <li>OCR inspection and first-launch onboarding.</li>
                    <li>Capture, recognition, and memory-management optimizations.</li>
                    <li>Expanded Settings, macOS 26 Liquid Glass styling,
                        and reliability improvements.</li>
                    <li>Local diagnostics without captured content.</li>
                </ul>
                <p><a href="https://github.com/Sayitobar/CopyShot/releases/tag/v2.0">
                Read the full release notes</a></p>
            ]]></description>
